    Consider these observations of two variables that correlate perfectly.
    The covariance matrix in this case is a 2x2 matrix of ones:

    >>> x = jnp.array([[0, 1, 2],
    ...                [0, 1, 2]])
    >>> jnp.cov(x)
    Array([[1., 1.],
