    points drawn from a 3-dimensional standard normal distribution:

    >>> key = jax.random.key(0)
    >>> x = jax.random.normal(key, shape=(3, 100))
    >>> with jnp.printoptions(precision=2):
    ...   print(jnp.cov(x))
    [[0.9  0.03 0.1 ]
     [0.03 1.   0.01]
     [0.1  0.01 0.85]]

